	Drill: {
		Start: Kakashi: I'll throw {0} kunai at you, and I'll take a different time to aim each one. Stand {1}–{2} tiles from me, watch the kunai, and press the substitution key just before it reaches you. In the drill no log takes it by itself; it's all your timing. No logs or chakra are used.
