	Story: {
		Cheer1: Welcome back!
		Cheer2: Amazing!
		Cheer3: The pride of the Leaf!
		Cheer4: Good work out there!
		Cheer5: Ichiraku ramen's on me today!
		Cheer6: You're back!
		Cheer7: That's a Leaf ninja for you!
		WaveDuoName: Zabuza Momochi, the Demon of the Mist, and Haku
		NameSeparator: ", "
		WelcomeWave: The whole Leaf has heard: in the Land of Waves, you beat the Demon of the Mist.
		WelcomeBosses: The whole Leaf has heard: you beat {0}!
		CheerWave: No way... THE Zabuza Momochi?
		CheerBoss: You beat {0}?!
		InsigniaReady: Three Mist Insignia collected. Craft the Zabuza Challenge Scroll at a workbench and face Zabuza and Haku at the broken bridge.

		Objective: {
			NoBridge: " (This world has no bridge yet: ask Kakashi for Tazuna's blueprint first.)"
			FindTazuna: C-rank mission: escort Tazuna the bridge builder home to the Land of Waves. He went ahead to the bridgehead: where the mist rolls in by the sea stands an unfinished bridge. Find him in the hut at its end.{0}
			Scout: C-rank mission: Tazuna says Mist ninja haunt the sea mist around the bridge. Take a walk along the misty shore; they will come to you.
			ReportToTazuna: The ambushers were Mist chunin, and they were after Tazuna. Go back to the hut at the bridgehead and get the truth.
			GetStronger: A-rank mission: Gato has hired the Demon of the Mist, Zabuza Momochi. You are not strong enough yet; get stronger first (beat the Eye of Cthulhu, or reach {0} max life).
			Lake: A-rank mission: on the road, Zabuza will strike by a lake on the surface. {0}
			Bridge: A hunter-nin took Zabuza away... but a hunter-nin who uses senbon was never there to kill him. The Mist ninja are sure to go to the broken bridge. Go back and look.
			Showdown: Zabuza is alive, in the mist at the broken bridge. Gather the Mist Insignia ({0}/3: one from each Demon Brother, one from Tazuna), craft the Zabuza Challenge Scroll at a workbench (it is not used up), use it around the bridge, and beat Zabuza and Haku.
			NoVillage: The Land of Waves arc is done. The Chunin Exams are held in the Hidden Leaf, and this world has no Leaf: the exam arc needs a new world. Everything else is yours to explore.
			Recommend: The Land of Waves arc is done. Head back to the Leaf; Kakashi has something to tell you.
			LostRecommendation: " (You don't have your recommendation: ask Kakashi for another.)"
			Written: Chunin Exams, first test, the written test: take your recommendation to the Leaf's Ninja Academy (west of the A-Un Gate) and find the proctor, Morino Ibiki, in the classroom.{0}
			WrittenRetry: First test: you gave up on the tenth question. Wait for the next dawn and sit it again at the Ninja Academy.{0}
			ForestGate: Chunin Exams, second test, the Forest of Death: collect your scroll at the gate of Training Ground 44, at the edge of the jungle{0}.
			ForestBoth: Second test: you have both the Heaven and Earth Scrolls. Go into the central tower in the middle of the jungle{0}.
			ForestHunt: Second test: take the {0} from other candidates. Walk the jungle surface and squads of three will find you ({1} beaten). Bring both scrolls to the central tower{2}.
			Prelims: Second test passed. Preliminaries: walk into the central tower's hall and face Dosu of the Sound one on one. His Resonating Echo Drill rings your ears: left and right swap for a moment.
			Training: Preliminaries passed. The finals are a month away; get stronger first (beat Skeletron, or reach {0} max life).
			Finals: Chunin Exam finals: walk into the stadium outside the Leaf's wall{0}. Your opponent is Gaara of the Sand; his sand blocks attacks from the front.
			Done: The Chunin Exam arc is done: the moment Gaara fell, the Destruction of the Leaf began. (Coming in a later update.)
		}

