	WrittenExam: {
		Q1: {
			Text: Which country is the Hidden Leaf Village in?
			A0: The Land of Fire
			A1: The Land of Wind
			A2: The Land of Water
			A3: The Land of Earth
		}

		Q2: {
			Text: Who is the Fourth Hokage?
			A0: Minato Namikaze
			A1: Hashirama Senju
			A2: Hiruzen Sarutobi
			A3: Tobirama Senju
		}

		Q3: {
			Text: What is the Third Hokage's name?
			A0: Hiruzen Sarutobi
			A1: Danzo Shimura
			A2: Jiraiya
			A3: Minato Namikaze
		}

		Q4: {
			Text: Who was Kakashi Hatake's teacher?
			A0: Minato Namikaze
			A1: Jiraiya
			A2: Might Guy
			A3: Iruka Umino
		}

		Q5: {
			Text: How does the Substitution Jutsu work?
			A0: You swap yourself for an object nearby (a log, say)
			A1: You make a clone with a real body
			A2: You take someone else's form
			A3: You trap your opponent in an illusion
		}

		Q6: {
			Text: Which is NOT one of the Academy's three basic jutsu?
			A0: Rasengan
			A1: Transformation Jutsu
			A2: Clone Jutsu
			A3: Substitution Jutsu
		}

		Q7: {
			Text: Chakra is a blend of which two energies?
			A0: Physical and spiritual energy
			A1: Natural energy and sage arts
			A2: Fire and wind
			A3: Blood and breath
		}

		Q8: {
			Text: Who is the Hidden Mist's "Demon"?
			A0: Zabuza Momochi
			A1: Kisame Hoshigaki
			A2: Haku
			A3: Mangetsu Hozuki
		}

		Q9: {
			Text: What is Haku's kekkei genkai?
			A0: Ice Release
			A1: Wood Release
			A2: Lava Release
			A3: Boil Release
		}

		Q10: {
			Text: What was the Land of Waves' bridge named in the end?
